 "findings": [
  {
   "evidence": "Existing atlas constructions do this: `FiniteBundleAtlas/Basic.lean:391` `@[expose, simps n center dom] def ofBaseSet` and `:432` `@[expose, reducible, simps n center dom] def append`.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/VectorBundle/Sobolev/Bordered/Atlas/Disc.lean",
   "fix": "Add `@[simps n center dom]` to `ballAtlas`, or `@[simp]` lemmas `ballAtlas_n`, `ballAtlas_center`, `ballAtlas_dom` and `mem_ballAtlas_dom_iff`.",
   "issue": "`ballAtlas` is a plain `def` with no `@[simps]` and no characterizing lemmas, so other files cannot learn its `n`, `center` or `dom` without unfolding it; the same applies to `fiveChartAtlas` and `eightChartAtlas`, which are built from it.",
   "line": 64
  },
  {
   "evidence": "A grep of mathlib/Mathlib/Analysis/Complex finds only `Complex.sq_norm` and `sq_norm_sub_sq_re/im`; there is no strict-inequality coordinate form of the norm.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/VectorBundle/Sobolev/Bordered/Atlas/Disc.lean",
   "fix": "Move them, public, to a general file on the complex norm (e.g. `Complex.lt_norm_iff_sq_lt`, `Complex.norm_sub_lt_iff_sq_lt`, `Complex.norm_le_one_of_re_sq_add_im_sq`); keep `exists_axis_sq_lt`, `fiveCenter` and `eightCenter` private.",
   "issue": "`private lt_norm_iff`, `private norm_sub_lt_iff` (line 91) and `private norm_le_one_of_sq` (line 102) state facts about \u2102 only, with no dependence on the atlases; they are general infrastructure hidden as private.",
   "line": 85
  }
 ],
